  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass-spring system has total mechanical energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. What is the displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> where kinetic and potential energies are equal?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = 0\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = \\frac{A}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = \\frac{A}{2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x = \\frac{A\\sqrt{3}}{2}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
